"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-083-luzou","book_id":"b-shiji-083","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-083-luzou"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p027","text":"居有閒，秦將樊於期得罪於秦王，亡之燕，太子受而舍之。鞠武諫曰：「不可。夫以秦王之暴而積怒於燕，足爲寒心，又況聞樊將軍之所在乎？是謂『委肉當餓虎之蹊』也，禍必不振矣！雖有管、晏，不能爲之謀也。願太子疾遣樊將軍入匈奴以滅口。請西約三晉，南連齊、楚，北購於單于，其後乃可圖也。」太子曰：「太傅之計，曠日彌久，心惛然，恐不能須臾。且非獨於此也，夫樊將軍窮困於天下，歸身於丹，丹終不以迫於彊秦而棄所哀憐之交，置之匈奴，是固丹命卒之時也。願太傅更慮之。」鞠武曰：「夫行危欲求安，造禍而求福，計淺而怨深，連結一人之後交，不顧國家之大害，此所謂『資怨而助禍』矣。夫以鴻毛燎於爐炭之上，必無事矣。且以鵰鷙之秦，行怨暴之怒，豈足道哉！燕有田光先生，其爲人智深而勇沈，可與謀。」太子曰：「願因太傅而得交於田先生，可乎？」鞠武曰：「敬諾。」出見田先生，道「太子願圖國事於先生也」。田光曰：「敬奉教。」乃造焉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0004","start":4,"end":9,"surface":"秦將樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"鞠武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0055","start":55,"end":58,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0084","start":84,"end":87,"surface":"管、晏","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱或擬議結盟對象未定，保留未解，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0096","start":96,"end":98,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0100","start":100,"end":103,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0125","start":125,"end":127,"surface":"單于","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、引古短稱或擬議結盟對象未定，保留未解，不補姓名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"太傅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0169","start":169,"end":172,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0181","start":181,"end":182,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0183","start":183,"end":184,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0206","start":206,"end":207,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0214","start":214,"end":216,"surface":"太傅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0221","start":221,"end":223,"surface":"鞠武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0309","start":309,"end":313,"surface":"田光先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004848","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0328","start":328,"end":330,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0335","start":335,"end":337,"surface":"太傅","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0341","start":341,"end":344,"surface":"田先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004848","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0349","start":349,"end":351,"surface":"鞠武","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004851","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0360","start":360,"end":363,"surface":"田先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004848","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0366","start":366,"end":368,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0373","start":373,"end":375,"surface":"先生","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004848","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m027-0378","start":378,"end":380,"surface":"田光","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004848","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p030","text":"久之，荊軻未有行意。秦將王翦破趙，虜趙王，盡收入其地，進兵北略地至燕南界。太子丹恐懼，乃請荊軻曰：「秦兵旦暮渡易水，則雖欲長侍足下，豈可得哉！」荊軻曰：「微太子言，臣願謁之。今行而毋信，則秦未可親也。夫樊將軍，秦王購之金千斤，邑萬家。誠得樊將軍首與燕督亢之地圖，奉獻秦王，秦王必説見臣，臣乃得有以報。」太子曰：「樊將軍窮困來歸丹，丹不忍以己之私而傷長者之意，願足下更慮之！」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0010","start":10,"end":14,"surface":"秦將王翦","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004854","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"趙王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004856","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0037","start":37,"end":40,"surface":"太子丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0045","start":45,"end":47,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0078","start":78,"end":80,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0101","start":101,"end":104,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0105","start":105,"end":107,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0119","start":119,"end":122,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0133","start":133,"end":135,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0151","start":151,"end":153,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0156","start":156,"end":159,"surface":"樊將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0163","start":163,"end":164,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m030-0165","start":165,"end":166,"surface":"丹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p031","text":"荊軻知太子不忍，乃遂私見樊於期曰：「秦之遇將軍可謂深矣，父母宗族皆爲戮沒。今聞購將軍首金千斤，邑萬家，將柰何？」於期仰天太息流涕曰：「於期毎念之，常痛於骨髓，顧計不知所出耳！」荊軻曰：「今有一言可以解燕國之患，報將軍之仇者，何如？」於期乃前曰：「爲之柰何？」荊軻曰：「願得將軍之首以獻秦王，秦王必喜而見臣，臣左手把其袖，右手揕其匈，然則將軍之仇報而燕見陵之愧除矣。將軍豈有意乎？」樊於期偏袒搤捥而進曰：「此臣之日夜切齒腐心也，乃今得聞教！」遂自剄。太子聞之，馳往，伏尸而哭，極哀。既已不可柰何，乃遂盛樊於期首函封之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0028","start":28,"end":32,"surface":"父母宗族","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、未名人物或待核稱呼保留未解；未補姓名、性別或親屬名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0116","start":116,"end":118,"surface":"於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0129","start":129,"end":131,"surface":"荊軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004841","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0145","start":145,"end":147,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0168","start":168,"end":170,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0182","start":182,"end":184,"surface":"將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0190","start":190,"end":193,"surface":"樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0224","start":224,"end":226,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004849","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m031-0250","start":250,"end":253,"surface":"樊於期","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004852","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-086-cike","book_id":"b-shiji-086","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-086-cike"},{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:p034","text":"遂至秦，持千金之資幣物，厚遺秦王寵臣中庶子蒙嘉。嘉爲先言於秦王曰：「燕王誠振怖大王之威，不敢舉兵以逆軍吏，願舉國爲内臣，比諸侯之列，給貢職如郡縣，而得奉守先王之宗廟。恐懼不敢自陳，謹斬樊於期之頭，及獻燕督亢之地圖，函封，燕王拜送于庭，使使以聞大王，唯大王命之。」秦王聞之，大喜，乃朝服，設九賓，見燕使者咸陽宮。荊軻奉樊於期頭函，而秦舞陽奉地圖柙，以次進。至陛，秦舞陽色變振恐，群臣怪之。荊軻顧笑舞陽，前謝曰：「北蕃蠻夷之鄙人，未嘗見天子，故振慴。願大王少假借之，使得畢使於前。」秦王謂軻曰：「取舞陽所持地圖。」軻既取圖奏之，秦王發圖，圖窮而匕首見。因左手把秦王之袖，而右手持匕首揕之。未至身，秦王驚，自引而起，袖絶。拔劍，劍長，操其室。時惶急，劍堅，故不可立拔。荊軻逐秦王，秦王環柱而走。群臣皆愕，卒起不意，盡失其度。而秦法，群臣侍殿上者不得持尺寸之兵；諸郎中執兵皆陳殿下，非有詔召不得上。方急時，不及召下兵，以故荊軻乃逐秦王。而卒惶急，無以撃軻，而以手共搏之。是時侍醫夏無且以其所奉藥囊提荊軻也。秦王方環柱走，卒惶急，不知所爲，左右乃曰：「王負劍！」負劍，遂拔以撃荊軻，斷其左股。荊軻廢，乃引其匕首以擿秦王，不中，中桐柱。秦王復撃軻，軻被八創。軻自知事不就，倚柱而笑，箕踞以罵曰：「事所以不成者，以欲生劫之，必得約契以報太子也。」於是左右既前殺軻，秦王不怡者良久。已而論功，賞群臣及當坐者各有差，而賜夏無且黃金二百溢，曰：「無且愛我，乃以藥囊提荊軻也。」","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-086-cike:m034-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"秦王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004850","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-